{"4798020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zero Contact", "steam_appid": 4798020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An entire city has suddenly lost contact with the outside world. Communications have gone silent, rescue teams have disappeared, and no one knows what happened inside the quarantine zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are sent into the city to investigate the disaster and uncover the truth behind its isolation. What begins as a search for answers quickly reveals a terrifying reality: the city has been overrun by hostile alien creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission unfolds in three stages:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take Out the Data of the City</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The whole city’s information is stored in a secure server room. Your first task is to locate the server, retrieve the data, and copy it safely. Be careful—don’t destroy the data, and make sure you survive the operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Their Weaknesses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creatures that roam the city are powerful and unlike anything humanity has encountered before. Through exploration, research, and experimentation, learn how they behave and identify the weaknesses that can be used against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the City</strong>Once </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the truth is revealed and the enemy's weaknesses are known, the final operation begins. Prepare yourself for the ultimate confrontation, eliminate the alien threat, and reclaim the city before the disaster spreads beyond its borders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the city rests on your ability to uncover the truth, adapt to an unknown enemy, and survive long enough to fight back.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An entire city has suddenly lost contact with the outside world. Communications have gone silent, rescue teams have disappeared, and no one knows what happened inside the quarantine zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are sent into the city to investigate the disaster and uncover the truth behind its isolation. What begins as a search for answers quickly reveals a terrifying reality: the city has been overrun by hostile alien creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission unfolds in three stages:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take Out the Data of the City</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The whole city’s information is stored in a secure server room. Your first task is to locate the server, retrieve the data, and copy it safely. Be careful—don’t destroy the data, and make sure you survive the operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Their Weaknesses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creatures that roam the city are powerful and unlike anything humanity has encountered before. Through exploration, research, and experimentation, learn how they behave and identify the weaknesses that can be used against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the City</strong>Once </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the truth is revealed and the enemy's weaknesses are known, the final operation begins. Prepare yourself for the ultimate confrontation, eliminate the alien threat, and reclaim the city before the disaster spreads beyond its borders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the city rests on your ability to uncover the truth, adapt to an unknown enemy, and survive long enough to fight back.</p>", "short_description": "Fight to reclaim a city overrun by aliens and zombies. Blast your way through infected streets, hunt down deadly enemies, uncover their weaknesses, and save the city from total destruction.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor